# `docs/` is deliberately NOT ignored. `docs/CODEBASE_LEARNING.md` is the
# project's master explanation -- architecture, ADRs, request flows, a
# file-by-file guide and the learning checkpoints -- and a clone without it is
# missing the document that explains everything else. It was ignored by
# accident; the Phase 10 audit caught it.

# `stitch/` stays ignored: it is ~30 MB of read-only reference designs (PNGs and
# generated HTML) that nothing in the build imports. The values taken from it --
# the colour tokens, the type scale -- live in `frontend/app/globals.css`, and
# the mascot is redrawn as inline SVG rather than shipped as a 760 KB PNG.
stitch/
docs/
